      "writtenOn": "2025-07-29T16:36:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This should probably be put in a grouped dict, something like `result.presentation.properties[\u0027gsutil_urls\u0027][link_name] \u003d link`\n\nThat way the URLs don\u0027t flood the top level output props dict.",
