      "message": "Oh, the output properties are not for each step, but for the entire build.\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromium/infra/infra_superproject/+/main:recipes-py/recipe_engine/engine_types.py;l\u003d294;drc\u003dfcfff5c5d231ef659e3ea2a6214441c87e3d8719\n\nI need to think about the key as `link_name` is default to `gsutil.upload`. So, it\u0027s likely to conflict with many links.\n\nIs `properties[\u0027gsutil_urls\u0027][step_name]` better since a step name should be unique?",
